Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 21:47:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ICE increment 3: SOS incident command panel + manual report +
 PDF
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- components/SosIncidentPanel: organizer incident command — auto-opens on device SOS or manual 'report for a rider'; milestone timeline (ack/dispatch/medic/helo/recovery/resolve), running clock, ICE snapshot behind a tap, dictation (Web Speech), printable timestamped PDF report
- migration 038: source/reported_by/opened_by on sos_incidents; open_sos_incident() richer signature (manual reporting, coords); resolve clears the rider SOS flag; open mirrors sos_at to light the live map
- dashboard event map tab: mount the panel for organizers

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
